010900* --- 2100-EDIT-INPUT: VALIDATE THE REQUEST
011000 2100-EDIT-INPUT.
011100     SET WS-NO-ERROR TO TRUE
011200     IF CA-CLAIM-ID = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
011300        SET WS-ERROR-FOUND TO TRUE
011400        MOVE 8 TO CA-RETURN-CD
