012300     MOVE ZERO TO DW-BUS-DAYS
012400     CALL 'CLRCM010' USING CLR-DATE-WORK
012500                      CLR-ERROR-BLOCK
012600     IF ERR-SQLCODE NOT = ZERO
012700        MOVE 'CALL CLRCM010' TO ERR-PARA
012800        PERFORM 8000-SQL-ERROR
012900     END-IF
013000     .
013100* --- 2200-APPLY: BUSINESS PROCESSING
013200 2200-APPLY.
013300     PERFORM 2300-READ-CLAIM
013400     PERFORM 2320-READ-SETTLEMENT
013500     PERFORM 2500-EDIT-CLAIM
013600     PERFORM 2510-EDIT-SETTLEMENT
013700     PERFORM 2520-EDIT-CLAIM-2
013800     PERFORM 2530-EDIT-SETTLEMENT-2
