019700     IF CLM-PRODUCT-CD = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
019800        ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT
019900        MOVE 'PRODUCT_CD MISSING' TO ERR-TEXT
020000     END-IF
020100     IF CLM-PERIL-CD = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
